  "created": "2026-09-10T06:57:25.433Z",
  "description": "The one reference a Rask application needs, server or browser. On net10.0 it brings the ASP.NET host plus every battery — database, mediator, background jobs, transactional email, cache, outbox, operator dashboard, durable logs, Web Push, and SQLite snapshots and continuous backup — with RaskApp.Create(args) as the entry point. On net10.0-browser it brings the WebAssembly host, the source-generated mediator, the query cache and remote dispatch. Everything referenced is wired and on; app.Configure(c => c.Jobs.Off()) is how an app does without one. Reference Rask.Server for a lean host with no database.",
  "iconFile": "rask-icon.png",
